{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55689","headline":"诗寄赠四明宝云通法师（二首） 一 · 钱俶","name":"诗寄赠四明宝云通法师（二首） 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"海角复天涯，形分道不赊。\n灯清读圜觉，香煖顶袈裟。\n戒比珠无类（疑当作「纇」），心犹镜断瑕。\n平生赖慈眼，南望一咨嗟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱俶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55689.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55689","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}